# Evaluation photos are fetched, never vendored: 11 MB of CC-BY-NC iNaturalist
# images, rebuildable byte-for-byte from the committed labels with
#   scripts/fetch_inat_eval.py --from-labels eval/inat/labels.csv
# The labels and the recorded model answers are text and ARE committed, because
# docs/EVALUATION.md quotes figures taken from them and a figure nobody can get
# back to is not a measurement.
eval/**/*.jpg
eval/**/*.jpeg
eval/**/*.png
eval-results/

